From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jay Leaton <58495321+jayleaton@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 14:59:08 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 38/79] flashnext_mia: one-line comments and docstrings within
 120 columns

Mia's comment blocks, kernel and RoCE comments, tools and tests docstrings
condensed to single lines. Code is unchanged; fn_qmmf_ld.cu's generator
writes the one-line footer it now carries. The vendored Triton sources in
tools/zig/flashnext_mia/triton/ stay byte-identical (their Triton hashes and
cubins depend on the text).
